{
  "name": "Enervation",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Champions Guild Automation:</em> A tendril of darkness drains a creature within 60 ft: DEX save. On a failure it takes 6d8 Necrotic damage, and on each of your later turns you can use a Bonus Action (Drain activity) to deal 2d8 Necrotic to it automatically; the spell ends if it leaves range or gets Total Cover. On a success it takes half the initial damage and the spell ends. Whenever the spell deals damage, you regain Hit Points equal to half the Necrotic damage dealt. +1d8 initial damage per slot level above 5.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
